<title>SWITZERLAND: Zurich May inflation rises to 0.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zurich May inflation rises to 0.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices fell 0.4 percent in May from the previous month for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.6 percent, the Federal Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				    May 1997    April 1997	May 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   -0.4 pct	 0.0 pct	-0.5 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+0.6 pct	+0.5 pct	 0.5 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	  102.9	   103.4	   102.4</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
